{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make the Nile Run Red</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Armoury for the Ages.</strong> Rend your enemies with sharpened khopesh or swarm them with deadly locust plagues using your ancient and arcane arsenal.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egypt is your playground. </strong>Crawl across village rooftops and scour gargantuan pyramids in an adventure spanning the length of the Nile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomb Rager.</strong> Plunder mysterious temples and tombs, navigating through traps and tunnels, and beating back the cult of Anubis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beasts, barbarians and belligerent Gods. </strong>Go up against enemies from both sides of the Duat!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOSMan!</strong> Find the titular time-and-space traveling mascot in every level, hoarding goodies for you to gorge on.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest and most ambitious release from bite-sized boomer shooter studio, DOSMan Games, Skarab combines frenetic combat with exploration and platforming to deliver an adventure inspired by the likes of Powerslave, Tomb Raider and Quake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557830?t=1765193754","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557830?t=1765193754","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557830/40588763b02460e83c108505f400bae21c907973/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765193754","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557830/40588763b02460e83c108505f400bae21c907973/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765193754","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptor